// A FLAT ROOF IS LIVED ON (INVENTED dressing, by each lot's own numbers): mats with fruit drying on them, store jars
// by the parapet, baskets, bedding rolled out for the night, a ladder, plants in pots. Everything stands inside the
// parapet and below the height of a shade frame (2.45 m over the deck).
const ROOFCLOTH = [DYE.madder, DYE.woad, DYE.saffron, DYE.madderDk, DYE.undyed];
